  "parentName": "PatchingAlgebra.faithfulSMul",
  "oldText":
  "suffices FaithfulSMul Rₒₒ (PatchingModule Λ M F) by\n    refine ⟨fun {x₁ x₂} H ↦ ?_⟩\n    obtain ⟨x₁, rfl⟩ := hf x₁\n    obtain ⟨x₂, rfl⟩ := hf x₂\n    obtain rfl : x₁ = x₂ := FaithfulSMul.eq_of_smul_eq_smul H\n    rfl",
